{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill, relaxing \ud83d\udd0e 3D hidden object game in 6 tiny cube worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized, lowpoly cube 3D dioramas. Click around, spot cleverly hidden items, and uncover a few interactive surprises. Cozy vibes, simple controls, zero stress. Perfect for quick casual sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433080/extras/f95959c0e11853271fcf67af631c4871.avif?t=1760349463\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddca Six</strong> 3D <strong>cube worlds</strong> and miniature dioramas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Cute <strong>hidden objects</strong>\u00a0game where you have to\u00a0<strong>find</strong>\u00a0different items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful clean art style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Easy controls - <strong>just use your Mouse to play</strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u21bb Rotate the camera</strong> to see what's hidden in the game world and click on it to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Hidden object</strong> gameplay focused on finding items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Abandoned, <strong>minimalist aesthetics</strong> with clean readability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Light <strong>interactive elements</strong> to keep things fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe The <strong>game saves automatically</strong> - don\u2019t worry about losing your progress! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 You can <strong>reset your progress</strong> so you or your loved ones can start over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2615\ud83d\ude0cChill, relaxing</strong>, pick-up-and-play design</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433080?t=1760349463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433080?t=1760349463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433080/fae85815c357e43ca005e916f90da1b9a0408f80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760349463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433080/fae85815c357e43ca005e916f90da1b9a0408f80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760349463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill, relaxing \ud83d\udd0e 3D hidden object game in 6 tiny cube worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized, lowpoly cube 3D dioramas. Click around, spot cleverly hidden items, and uncover a few interactive surprises. Cozy vibes, simple controls, zero stress. Perfect for quick casual sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433080/extras/f95959c0e11853271fcf67af631c4871.avif?t=1760349463\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddca Six</strong> 3D <strong>cube worlds</strong> and miniature dioramas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Cute <strong>hidden objects</strong>\u00a0game where you have to\u00a0<strong>find</strong>\u00a0different items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful clean art style!</p></li><li><p class=\